ng: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">수업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">개설강좌조회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">]</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">의 해당과목 옆</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">휴보강내역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">을</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;\"</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">조회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">“</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 112.5pt; text-indent: -112.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">(\"</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">휴보강내역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">\"</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">칸이 보이지 않을 경우 하단 가로 스크롤 조정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 112.5pt; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -112.5pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 22.6pt; text-indent: -22.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">□</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">휴보강일괄입력</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(3</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">월 초 입력 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">이후 재보강이 등록된 경우 위의 보강일자가 변경되므로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">수업 전 반드시 보강일자를 확인하여야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 22.6pt; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -22.6pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 22.7pt; text-indent: -22.7pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">□</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">기타 학사 일정은 홈페이지 교육 대학학사안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">학사일정 참조 이외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">휴보강 관련 여부는 해당 과목 교수님께 확인 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 24pt; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -24pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">□</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">기말고사 기간 및 종강일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">: 6. 17.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 6. 23.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">종강일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 21.5pt; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">공휴일 지정보강기간에는 원래 요일의 수업이 없고 지정된 일자의 보강수업만 운영되므로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">수강 시 착오없으시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 15.5pt; text-indent: -15.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">휴강일 별로 보강일자가 상이하니 해당일자를 반드시 확인요망</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 15.5pt; text-indent: -15.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 21.5pt; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">공휴일지정보강기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(6. 9.~6. 16.)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">에는 시험실시가 불가</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">하나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">부득이한 사정으로 해당주차에 기말 시험이 실시될 경우 반드시 학생 본인의 보강수업 유무를 확인하여 불이익을 받는 경우가 없도록 하여주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">모든 수업의 휴보강은 통합정보시스템에 등록 후 운영함이 원칙입니다</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 15.5pt; text-indent: -15.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">시험 또는 보강수업이 중복되는 경우 통합정보시스템에 등록된 수업이 우선이으로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 38.4pt; text-indent: -38.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">☞&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">학생은 본인의 수업유무를 해당 과목 교수님에게 알려 등록되지 않은 시험</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">또는 보강수업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">의 일자를 재지정하도록 요청하여야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 38.4pt; text-indent: -38.4pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 15.5pt; text-indent: -15.5pt; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2026. 4.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 15.5pt; text-indent: -15.5pt; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 18pt;\">교무처장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
